Detailed verification of the completed adaptive cases revealed two distinct implementation insights:

\subsection{Lineage reconciliation: sensitivity study vs production batch}
A rigorous audit of repository artifacts reconciled the element-count differences between earlier sensitivity catalogs and the active production models:
\begin{itemize}
  \item Case~$A_2$: contains $15{,}396$ finite elements ($14{,}963$ quads + $433$ tris), compared to $17{,}687$ in the historical sensitivity study.
